# # /spondeo/
#
# Spondeo: records of agreements signed on WhatsApp, a project of omnyss
# (https://omnyss.one/). Each agreement text and each certificate names its
# record by a permanent address, so that it keeps resolving if the project
# moves to another host:
#
#   https://w3id.org/spondeo/s/<record token>  the record and its certificate
#   https://w3id.org/spondeo/id/<SHA-256>      a certificate named by the hash of its content
#   https://w3id.org/spondeo/keys/             the provider's public keys
#   https://w3id.org/spondeo/log/              the daily public log
#   https://w3id.org/spondeo/tools/            the offline checker
#
# https://w3id.org/spondeo/... redirects to https://spondeo.omnyss.one/...
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Spondeo project (omnyss)
# GitHub username: omnyssone

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://spondeo.omnyss.one/$1 [R=302,L]
